WEBVTT

00:10:25.705 --> 00:10:32.203
(Audience claps)

00:10:32.227 --> 00:10:33.377
Now listen.

00:10:33.401 --> 00:10:36.570
(Singing) Fela Kuti in the 1970s

00:10:36.594 --> 00:10:38.048
inspires me.

00:10:38.072 --> 00:10:41.231
All he wanted was his people to be free

00:10:41.255 --> 00:10:43.784
from the colony,

00:10:43.808 --> 00:10:47.650
like Mahatma Gandhi in the 1940s.

00:10:47.674 --> 00:10:51.038
I've been reading about women's history

00:10:51.062 --> 00:10:52.841
in the 1920s,

00:10:52.865 --> 00:10:55.514
thinking about how I could be
so much better.

00:10:57.476 --> 00:11:00.080
Thinking about all the tears I've cried.